# Do not blanket-ignore .map/.ini/.json/.csv/.diff or archive extensions:
# they may be authored game data, fixtures, or intentional audit evidence.
# Keep deps/Phobos trackable as a submodule and .vcxproj.filters as shared IDE data.
# Personal research stays in .git/info/exclude, not a shared ignore rule.
